<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strigmentum</span></b> , i, n.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>that which is scratched</i> or <i>scraped off</i>, <i>a scraping</i> (post-Aug.),
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				20, 3, 8, § 17</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>filth</i> or <i>dirt scraped off</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 6 <i>med.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 2, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 51,
				74, § 160</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 4, 13, §
			51</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Max. 9, 14</span></i>, ext. 2 al.</div>
